{"game": "arc-raiders", "language": "english", "appid": 1808500, "month": "2026-04", "window": 2, "start_date": 1775606400, "end_date": 1776297599, "month_true_total": 8254, "quota": 13, "returned": 13, "pulled_at": "2026-09-10 21:18:51 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "223340527", "author": {"steamid": "76561199561875545", "personaname": "Kevin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199561875545/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 33567, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 29960, "last_played": 1781209192, "avatar": "7f7bbc6748c166bb09c9e1ec0bf671feb982edef"}, "language": "english", "review": "Don't bother to try and engage in the game content, you'll just get shot in the back by some \"PVP\" players while you're fighting the ARC. The aggression based matchmaking is a joke.... 500 hours of play, with almost no PVP with the exception of defending myself... 1 kill and you'll instantly be in KOS lobbies.  Solo, you can find a friendly lobby but it's getting increasingly difficult with the dropping player counts.  If you want to play with friends, family, kids, etc.... don't bother.  DUO / TRIO is instantly a KOS matches despite not being a PVP type player.  Until they add a PVP / PVE selector I won't play anymore.  If I could get a refund I would.", "timestamp_created": 1776297180, "timestamp_updated": 1776297180, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 9, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.535324752330780029", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 29, "count": 2}, {"reaction_type": 24, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "223340403", "author": {"steamid": "76561198131223275", "personaname": "Sumbusa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198131223275/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 2091, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2035, "last_played": 1776594609, "avatar": "a41301d4b9e1d39dda8f88f1c057b74f846482c7"}, "language": "english", "review": "don't get me wrong game is good but the bugs is insanely annoying but its fine we can deal with it but what actually makes me mad is the pvp experience i really do like pve in this game but i don't want to play pvp why you force me to play with pvp players while i don't shoot anyone and play safe cause i like to play vs bots not players why forcing me to something that i hate. please make pve mode i stopped playing the game already cause of this..", "timestamp_created": 1776296998, "timestamp_updated": 1776296998, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.496957242488861084", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 24, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "223339463", "author": {"steamid": "76561198772581307", "personaname": "Downytupon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/downytupon/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 7120, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5475, "last_played": 1779636351, "avatar": "37f5720999d7a433597f30a694df045fc1d4bfbe"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's my first time playing an extraction shooter.\n\nI have a lot of 2000+ hours of gameplay on cs2 and other competitive fps games.\nAnd I love survival games with base building.\n\nThe only thing lacking for me from this game is a system or \"base\" outside of the maps.\nA sort of \"safe space\", raider base, hideout.\nSure we have the projects but I think a 3d navigable base where we can physically see the progress of our progress by walking around our base and expanding on it would really bring the thing that this game is missing for me. A dedicated, customizable 3D hideout. The \"Projects\" are a good start but a physically navigable base would tie it all together for me. Seeing my progress reflected in a local world would make every successful extraction feel that much rewarding.\n\nThe biggest \"plus\" of this game for me is the sound design, it is simply gorgeous and really functional. In CS I use audio a lot for context clues, arc radiers does that so much better. The balance, they've somehow struck a really good balance between the arc difficulty and pvp battles. Both players styles will find their home in this game.\n\nTLDR: Love the extraction shooter genre as a first time player, would like physical base system to anchor progression.", "timestamp_created": 1776295641, "timestamp_updated": 1776295641, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223339137", "author": {"steamid": "76561198880080607", "personaname": "Sr3n", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Sr3n/", "num_games_owned": 100, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 2507, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2507, "last_played": 1776291191, "avatar": "925ee67b245cd79b2c7ddd996bc51fb58342d4bb"}, "language": "english", "review": "[h1]Stunning visuals, zero soul. Stay away if you like PvE.[/h1]\n\nI really didn’t want to give this a thumbs down. The game is technically a masterpiece—the sound design is insane, the robots move like nothing I’ve seen before, and the graphics are pure eye candy. But all that polish can’t hide how miserable the actual experience has become.\n\nI’m a 100% PvE player. I’ve put in over 40 hours, and in all that time, I’ve only killed ONE person (and that was self-defense at the very first match). I carry a defib every single match and have saved over a dozen strangers just trying to be a \"good neighbor.\" But in this game, kindness is just an invitation to get backstabbed.\n\nJust today, I was literally sharing blueprints and healing a guy in one match, only to be hunted down and gunned down for three matches straight right after. It’s not \"tense\" or \"emergent\"—it’s just toxic. The game actively rewards \"rats\" who hide at extraction points, risking absolutely nothing with their trash gear, just to kill you and take your hard-earned loot. There’s no karma system, no penalty for being a jerk, nothing.\n\nDon’t be fooled by the \"Positive\" rating. That was the early hype when people actually worked together. Now? As players rapidly drop off, it’s just a playground for griefers. Until Embark adds a dedicated PvE mode, don't waste your time or your sanity. It’s a beautiful game that leaves you feeling bitter and frustrated.", "timestamp_created": 1776295137, "timestamp_updated": 1776295561, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52584528923034668", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "hardware": {"system_ram": "48689", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D 8-Core Processor           ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080", "vram_size": 15977}, "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 29, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "223339034", "author": {"steamid": "76561198397897402", "personaname": "Fire4578", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198397897402/", "num_games_owned": 2, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 9029, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 845, "last_played": 1786638623, "avatar": "ef4ef590b11a89142f1ec4c5fe112e40f39c6546"}, "language": "english", "review": "best game ever.", "timestamp_created": 1776294963, "timestamp_updated": 1776294963, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32657", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 5 5600 6-Core Processor              ", "adapter_description": "AMD Radeon RX 6600", "vram_size": 8146}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223338908", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996987977", "personaname": "Mario Boi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197996987977/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 39986, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 763, "playtime_at_review": 27383, "last_played": 1788823611, "avatar": "157724ea2c5dbcdffeb3d179eddf99a4736f70c2"}, "language": "english", "review": "DON'T SHOOT.", "timestamp_created": 1776294786, "timestamp_updated": 1776294786, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223338867", "author": {"steamid": "76561199138302547", "personaname": "PERCS-WRLD999", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199138302547/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 17691, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11857, "last_played": 1782098580, "avatar": "d740bdfd24aa4c9a35015bf6395c1a281a996693"}, "language": "english", "review": "loaded in. eventually got into a match. got downed. got called a ♥♥♥♥♥ for just existing 10/10 would recommend", "timestamp_created": 1776294715, "timestamp_updated": 1776294715, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223338724", "author": {"steamid": "76561199500406092", "personaname": "Exbright", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199500406092/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 11942, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11111, "last_played": 1785035822, "avatar": "5c51ca468a1d37f32931d310ea391b87c294d082"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is the only game that got me really hooked in a while. I played this game non stop till  10 in the morning because this game is so addicting. Sometimes from the lack of updates, Arc Raiders can get a bit dull. Anyways I recommend this game to anyone who's looking for a good game to grind and have a great time. I LOVE THIS GAME!", "timestamp_created": 1776294515, "timestamp_updated": 1776294515, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223338525", "author": {"steamid": "76561199840281937", "personaname": "Unfitcooter", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199840281937/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 775, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 483, "last_played": 1784704963, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfe